                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                        "entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the power of generating, propagating, originating, or producing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05b4cb42-308b-47a1-be39-a64ad3475a33",
                                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                                "text": "That generative particle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bd9fcdd-b65c-4d79-a528-396626678353",
                                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                                "text": "Of course, structures like those associated with (36) and (37) constitute only a tiny subset of the infinite set of well-formed sentence structures found in English. We can increase the Generative Capacity of our grammar ( = the set of structures which it generates) either by expanding the Lexicon on the one hand, or by expanding the Categorial Rules (i.e. Phrase Structure Rules) on the other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a7d9353-ff01-4dae-8581-d899c20609d1",
                                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                                "text": "The document states that despite its ongoing advancements, generative AI is liable to the United States’s current copyright principles, which take a strict stance on what material—human- or machine-made—qualifies for protection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                                        "entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Reproductive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ff352f-fcd5-45d3-b53b-770fd122da48",
                                                "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                                                "text": "Hence the ubiquity of Priapus himself as a sculptural representative of the generative principle, populated the Roman gardens, assertive in ithyphallic pose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb565b64-8369-4538-a7a0-6925f8d1cf0e",
                                                "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                                                "text": "This ceremony seals the covenant in the flesh of the male generative organ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "97a8a871-8f64-417a-ad8b-3363cdb18742",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0721932-4716-3652-999d-07628a3f3a17",
                        "target_lang_word": "sexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "485f93bb-07c0-30ec-a6f9-7f246f09b301",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Arising from the fact of being male or female; pertaining to sex or gender, or to the social relations between the sexes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "785d0253-1494-4aa5-a2f3-f00145e3e5f2",
                                                "sense_id": "485f93bb-07c0-30ec-a6f9-7f246f09b301",
                                                "text": "Women face sexual discrimination in the workplace."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08c1ad7b-2467-3387-b40b-32a2f57ca145",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of sexual reproduction; sexed, sexuate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5bef70b-4b1d-3598-8fa3-2d54d01115c7",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to sexual intercourse or other intimate physical contact."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cfb6151-bc6c-4bc3-b7bd-4e517c7b0346",
                                                "sense_id": "f5bef70b-4b1d-3598-8fa3-2d54d01115c7",
                                                "text": "Giving oral sex is my favorite sexual act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1caeb61e-b3d1-4ec3-bb83-aaf2a652b5fb",
                                                "sense_id": "f5bef70b-4b1d-3598-8fa3-2d54d01115c7",
                                                "text": "One particularly damaging, but often ignored, effect of conflict on education is the proliferation of attacks on schools[…]as children, teachers or school buildings become the targets of attacks. Parents fear sending their children to school. Girls are particularly vulnerable to sexual violence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bf281b4-dec8-458d-a633-0f7c7d8078a3",
                                                "sense_id": "f5bef70b-4b1d-3598-8fa3-2d54d01115c7",
                                                "text": "“When you’re not numbing out with substances and suddenly you’re face to face with somebody you want to be sexual with, that can be really scary at first,” said Laura Rademacher, a licensed marriage and family therapist in Minneapolis who offers a class on sober sex in her practice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "039f4715-8a6c-3b0e-a973-ca40753274d4",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterised by sexual feelings or behaviour; possessing sexuality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e8102c6-06d1-48d4-a91e-2d6d9fca4c15",
                                                "sense_id": "039f4715-8a6c-3b0e-a973-ca40753274d4",
                                                "text": "She's a very sexual woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0358f85d-2a5e-4761-bbac-41e97fbc8b12",
                                                "sense_id": "039f4715-8a6c-3b0e-a973-ca40753274d4",
                                                "text": "We don't often think of Jesus as a sexual person, but He certainly was not asexual. He was not just God on earth. He was fully human and […] He was sexual, single, and celibate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "101be9ba-87b9-3404-974d-167b18f49978",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to sexuality as a cultural phenomenon; relating to sexual behaviour or conduct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c51d24b-7043-40eb-8e8c-a1ea681898b8",
                                                "sense_id": "101be9ba-87b9-3404-974d-167b18f49978",
                                                "text": "a sexual innuendo"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38d7e0d4-8971-44a1-bf0a-499ab9cf49e1",
                                                "sense_id": "101be9ba-87b9-3404-974d-167b18f49978",
                                                "text": "one's sexual preferences"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bb845d5-4bfa-30b5-a6ee-6308e581e023",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Experiencing sexual attraction; not asexual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b2a758d-683b-46ed-ba00-afcad7d89e20",
                                                "sense_id": "4bb845d5-4bfa-30b5-a6ee-6308e581e023",
                                                "text": "[…] “You know, there are asexuals with sexual partners.” His ears flicked, and he grinned. “There's things both of us can try to do[…]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "161a2a1f-bc58-49a4-bb14-a5802308159b",
                                                "sense_id": "4bb845d5-4bfa-30b5-a6ee-6308e581e023",
                                                "text": "Izzy tells me that at her high school the most useful distinction is not between heterosexuals and homosexuals but between those who are sexual and those who are not. The abstainers call themselves “aces,” short for “asexuals.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6693be46-7577-3dc9-b1d7-2af9d2d1fe70",
                                        "entry_id": "653246c7-362f-3e86-9c59-0408593427dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the female sex."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "528ae34c-a04a-4d7a-b391-af2f8bf12cfa",
                                                "sense_id": "6693be46-7577-3dc9-b1d7-2af9d2d1fe70",
                                                "text": "[T]he inquiry is whether she have reason or not. If she have, which, for a moment, I will take for granted, she was not created merely to be the solace of man, and the sexual should not destroy the human character."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13b57e0b-4a89-3a62-8113-c5933848ca41",
                                        "entry_id": "804317e6-d63f-3822-84a2-02d696c9c623",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A species which reproduces by sexual rather than asexual reproduction, or a member of such a species."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e4e995d-bb03-38a8-8c1f-bab3410bf862",
                                        "entry_id": "804317e6-d63f-3822-84a2-02d696c9c623",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who experiences sexual attraction, a person who has interest in or desire for sex (especially as contrasted with an asexual)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb78e90a-c719-473e-80bb-d75ea24855bb",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4e995d-bb03-38a8-8c1f-bab3410bf862",
                                                "text": "The findings suggest that asexuality is best conceptualized as a lack of sexual attraction; however, asexuals varied greatly in their experience of sexual response and behavior. Asexuals partnered with sexuals acknowledged having to 'negotiate' sexual activity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635f0a3b-555b-4429-bf89-c48c2dae261b",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4e995d-bb03-38a8-8c1f-bab3410bf862",
                                                "text": "In this article we use absence of sexual attraction to others as a definition but recognise that this definition is contested. […] [A survey] was also advertised online (without explicitly mentioning asexuality in the advert), thus aiming to reach a mixture of asexuals and sexuals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1324e645-5681-4e0e-a328-a964732d0a70",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0721932-4716-3652-999d-07628a3f3a17",
                        "target_lang_word": "sexuel",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sexuel",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05f702d1-755d-3f8e-aeaf-7897709fcc08",
                                        "entry_id": "33e30279-1fb3-3afc-8853-b35547790a71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif au sexe, chez l’être humain, les animaux et les plantes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e6faa18-192c-4106-87e3-e7b7827ba366",
                                                "sense_id": "05f702d1-755d-3f8e-aeaf-7897709fcc08",
                                                "text": "Lorsque l’homosexualité intégrera la normalité, il faudra alors instituer le régime isosexuel où tous les rôles sexuels seront abolis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a1c522b-be41-4d0f-914c-2adb58167a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "05f702d1-755d-3f8e-aeaf-7897709fcc08",
                                                "text": "Les différences sexuelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c5da888-f750-460b-880a-c7420d9942c7",
                                                "sense_id": "05f702d1-755d-3f8e-aeaf-7897709fcc08",
                                                "text": "Les parties sexuelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7e76201-495e-49d5-995e-7158e5b57568",
                                                "sense_id": "05f702d1-755d-3f8e-aeaf-7897709fcc08",
                                                "text": "Les organes sexuels."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                        "entry_id": "33e30279-1fb3-3afc-8853-b35547790a71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à la sexualité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4645891-d3a6-4730-b3e6-c519d8362e08",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                                "text": "Depuis les Hervieu, les Bernstein, les Marguerite^([sic]), les Paul Adam, les Pierre Louys et leur séquelle de journalistes caudataires, prêchèrent l’émancipation sexuelle, le bris des tenailles et le culte d’Aphrodite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1f0f7e3-b973-42e5-9fc9-cb4a7880a8b4",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                                "text": "[…] où l’on découvre que les hommes préhistoriques ne jouaient pas uniquement à « Moi Tarzan, toi Jane ». Leurs pratiques sexuelles étant nettement plus variées. Homosexualité, zoophilie, masturbation…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b820f6a8-4739-4739-b300-bcfb2fc640e5",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                                "text": "Il potassait à la chandelle, au gué, au gué\nDes traités de maintien sexuel, au gué, au gué."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0da880cb-5e43-4d52-9f16-1b778c370669",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                                "text": "Ce retour à l’honnêteté affective et sexuelle des élites françaises est un progrès probablement plus important pour notre pays que les changements et manipulations constitutionnels de l’après-guerre ou de 1958."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d589f11f-1ea3-479f-a3e5-b9bc9fe093b1",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1b9c71-c2e3-3fe1-8cdd-1813a93801d0",
                                                "text": "« De toutes les aberrations sexuelles, la plus singulière est encore la chasteté », disait Remy de Gourmont.\nSes contemporains étaient de son avis. Dieu merci !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fb7d5b9-d6cb-3b5a-91e0-c896d9a50932",
                                        "entry_id": "33e30279-1fb3-3afc-8853-b35547790a71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui aime à faire l’amour ; qui provoque cet instinct chez l’autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de39e0fe-88fd-41cc-8c58-1a95c922fc84",
                                                "sense_id": "9fb7d5b9-d6cb-3b5a-91e0-c896d9a50932",
                                                "text": "Elle est très sexuelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
